JC,

Hi, I'm new user. I have question similar to that posted here: http://sourceforge.net/p/tinn-r/discussion/481901/thread/13db554d/

I have a brief file: myfile.Rnw.  Ctrl-k produces myfile.tex.  I click on ctrl-alt-P and it displays nicely in Acrobat.

I'm looking for a shortcut that will produce myfile.tex AND display it in Acrobat (or Sumatra).  Is there an option for this?

Daniel

